  "body": "### Problem Statement\n\nI would like strands to support Agent Skills as described on https://claude.com/blog/skills . \n\n\n### Proposed Solution\n\n_No response_\n\n### Use Case\n\nThat would enable loading of relevant knowledge files depending on the specific task, utilizing the context window more effectively.  This would be a generic model customization tool, that would allow reusing an agent for different tasks without code changes, just adding or removing skills that are basically a bunch of markdown files with prompts\n\n### Alternatives Solutions\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional Context\n\n_No response_",
